  "id": "37b52c33-9744-4808-af57-0c270b6bc0d7",
  "message": "Sure thing! Here’s a quick rundown of the finance‑analysis crew I help coordinate:\n\n| Role | What they do | Typical focus |\n|------|--------------|----------------|\n| **mapper_cash** | Scans the expense database for vendor patterns that are paid **in cash** (method = “CASH”). | Finds cash‑purchase merchants, flags recurring cash spend, builds the cash‑monthly‑totals report. |\n| **mapper_card** | Looks for transactions made with **card swipes** (method = “CARD”). | Generates the card‑monthly‑totals, highlights new card merchants and any odd spikes. |\n| **mapper_bank** | Handles ACH, online‑transfer and other **bank‑based payments** (method = “BANK”). | Produces the bank‑monthly‑totals and spots recurring bills that come directly from the bank. |\n| **mapper_other** | Catches everything else – paper checks, misc or uncategorized items (method = “OTHER”). | Supplies the “other‑monthly‑totals” and helps catch stray or mis‑tagged expenses. |\n| **synthesizer** | Takes the four mapper reports and merges them. It also flags — missed bills, amount anomalies, and possible new recurring expenses. | Outputs the synthesis_report.html and a summary of anything that looks off. |\n| **receipt_scanner** | Scans uploaded receipt images, matches them to expense rows, and finds orphaned or mislabeled receipts. | Generates the orphaned‑receipts report and helps keep receipt‑expense linkage clean. |\n| **expense_reconciler** | Looks for expense rows that lack a matching receipt (excluding known receipt‑less transactions). | Produces the unaccounted‑expenses_report.md. |\n| **progress_check** | A read‑only “status” tool that tells you which reports already exist, their timestamps, and whether anything is stale. | Gives you a quick health‑check without running any heavy analysis. |\n\nTogether they keep the company’s spending transparent, catch errors early, and make sure we have up‑to‑date reports for cash, card, bank, and other transactions. Let me know if you’d like more details on any of the agents or want to run one of their analyses!",
